  U_{M^c}}\big|\mathcal{F}^{-1}\big(\Theta\eta_N G(\: \cdot\: ;n, w)\big)(B_hx+n)\big|^2\bigg)^r
\\=C_{2r}^{2r}\int_{\mathbb{C}^d}
\sum_{n\in \mathbb{N}_{B_h}^d}\sum_{x\in\mathbb{Z}^d}\Big|\mathcal{F}^{-1}\Big(\Theta\eta_N\Big(\sum_{w\in\mathcal
	U_{M^c}}z_{w} G(\: \cdot\: ;n, w)\Big)\Big)(B_hx+n)\Big|^{2r}e^{-\pi |z|^2}{\rm d}z\\
