\end{multline}
This completes the proof of Proposition \ref{prop:5}.

  It remains to show that  there exists a constant $C_{\rho, r}>0$
  such that for any $M=\{j_1,\ldots, j_m\}\subseteq\mathbb{N}_{k}$ any $\sigma=(s_{j_1},\ldots,
